   "text": "Cheil Worldwide, a marketing company of the Samsung group in which Samsung Electronics holds 28.43%, or its agency Iris has done advertising, public-relations or search-marketing work for five registry brands: Chevrolet (for GM Korea, 2017), BMW (UK consumer public relations, 2018), Bentley (experiential agency of record in the Americas from 2021), Jack Daniel's (UK digital agency from 2022, since replaced) and Eucerin (search marketing for Beiersdorf from 2024). (Conflict-of-interest screen of v0.62, DEVIATIONS Entry 0, Part F.) As Denon, these five brands stay in every analysis, and every test is also reported without them and Denon (sensitivity S-COI)."
